===== README.md =====
# fixture

A fixture project.

[![CI](https://github.com/fixture/fixture/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/fixture/fixture/actions/workflows/ci.yml) [![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-blue.svg)](LICENSE)

## Requirements

Node.js >= 24.0.0 (`.nvmrc` pins 24.18.0; run `nvm use`). Enforced via `engine-strict`, so installs fail fast on an unsupported version.

## Install

```sh
npm install fixture
```

## Develop

```sh
npm run dev     # start the dev server
npm run build   # production build
```

## License

MIT © Fixture Author <fixture@example.com>

===== SECURITY.md =====
# Security Policy

If you discover a security vulnerability, please **do not** open a public issue.
Instead, report it privately to the maintainers (e.g. via GitHub Security
Advisories). We will respond as quickly as possible.

